0.022,0.008,0.003,0.001,0.001,0.0,0.001,0.001,0.001],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"Pirates need rum like a certain merperson needs to take the hint and stop calling you. It can't be guaranteed the crew'll remember to drink water, but it's a rare pirate who forgets to drink rum.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.352,"end":11.04,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":36,"words":36},"large":{"start":0.352,"end":11.02,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":36,"words":36},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"You head inside and place a ridiculously large order of rum to be sent to your ship. As you survey the decor in the bar, your heart stops as you see, standing in the corner, the table made of the glass coffin of your old friend and crewmate, Mick the Drunk. Wait, that was this bar he wanted his remains displayed?!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":11.424,"end":31.328,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":61,"words":61},"large":{"start":11.424,"end":31.26,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":61,"words":61},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"You shudder. It's macabre, even for a pirate.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":31.68,"end":35.264,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":8},"large":{"start":31.68,"end":35.16,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":8},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"You need a distraction. Might as well add a picture to your coat of arms. Nothing says pirate like a bar, rum, and some odd decor to keep ‘em guessing.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":35.68,"end":45.664,"frac":0.933,"status":"ok","matched":28,"words":30},"large":{"start":35.68,"end":45.664,"frac":0.933,"status":"ok","matched":28,"words":30},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"⚠️ Don't forget, download each photo right after you take it, or risk losing that masterpiece to the digital deep.","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":19},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":19},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68faac4e0848e_JM5%20intro.png"}